	...
```
Hmm — better: iterate friendly turrets via `perception.query...`? Turrets aren't in "entities" group; but I can use `get_tree().get_nodes_in_group("turrets")` directly in HeroAI (HeroAI is a Node). Keep it simple:

```gdscript
