		var next = _find_safe_recall_spot_avoiding(threat.global_position)
		...
```

Hmm, need to keep it simple and robust. Let me restructure minimally:

```gdscript
# ==================== 安全回城 ====================
var _recall_avoid := Vector3.ZERO        # 被迫取消回城时敌人所在位置（换点用，0=无）
var _recall_avoid_t := 0.0

func _recall_safe_behavior(delta):
